---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Desire Resorts Dining & Gourmet Guide
description: "A full guide to Desire Resorts' all-inclusive restaurants and lounges, dress codes, reservation policies, and what to expect at each venue."
permalink: '/dining/'
---

<article class="dining-editorial page container">
  <header class="dining-header text-center">
    <span class="hero-eyebrow">Gastronomy & Lounges</span>
    <h1>Dinner Is Part of the Experience</h1>
    <p class="hero-lead" style="max-width: var(--max-paragraph); margin: 0 auto 28px; color: var(--color-espresso-soft);">
      From barefoot oceanfront grills and wood-fired pizza to multi-course aphrodisiac tastings, meals, wines, and cocktails are generally included as part of the all-inclusive stay.
    </p>
  </header>

  <!-- Concierge Culinary Reassurance Banner -->
  <div class="verdict-banner text-center" style="max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto 40px;">
    <h3>What to Know About Desire Dining</h3>
    <p>
      Breakfast and lunch tend to be relaxed (resort beachwear or cover-ups are typically fine). 
      Dinner generally shifts to a more elegant atmosphere, often described as <strong>resort chic</strong>&mdash;usually collared shirts and pants or dress shorts for men, and cocktail attire or a summer dress for women. Dress codes and inclusions can vary by restaurant and change over time, so confirm current requirements before your stay.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Segmented Property Filters -->
  <div class="dining-filter-bar text-center">
    <span class="filter-label">Explore by Resort:</span>
    <div class="filter-pills" role="group" aria-label="Filter options">
      <button type="button" class="dining-filter-pill is-active" aria-pressed="true" data-property="all">All Restaurants</button>
      <button type="button" class="dining-filter-pill" aria-pressed="false" data-property="drm">Desire Riviera Maya</button>
      <button type="button" class="dining-filter-pill" aria-pressed="false" data-property="pearl">Desire Pearl</button>
    </div>
    <span id="dining-filter-status" class="sr-only" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">Showing all restaurants.</span>
  </div>

  <p class="small-text" style="color: var(--color-espresso-soft); max-width: var(--max-paragraph); margin: 0 auto 24px; text-align: center;">
    Dress codes, service hours, and reservation policies below reflect typical patterns at each restaurant and can change&mdash;confirm current details with the resort before your stay. <strong>Last verified:</strong> September 24, 2026, against current information published by Desire Resorts.
  </p>

  <!-- Restaurant Card Grid -->
  <div id="dining-grid" class="dining-cards-grid grid-auto">
    {% for restaurant in collections.restaurant %}
      <article class="dining-card" data-property="{{ restaurant.data.property }}">
        <div class="dining-card__top">
          <span class="property-tag">
            {% if restaurant.data.property == 'drm' %}
              Riviera Maya
            {% elif restaurant.data.property == 'pearl' %}
              Pearl
            {% else %}
              Both Resorts
            {% endif %}
          </span>
          <span class="reservation-badge {{ 'is-required' if restaurant.data.reservationRequired else 'is-walkin' }}">
            {{ 'Reservations Typically Required' if restaurant.data.reservationRequired else 'Usually Walk-In Friendly' }}
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="dining-card__header">
          <h3>{{ restaurant.data.title | safe }}</h3>
          {% if restaurant.data.cuisine %}
            <span class="cuisine-tag">{{ restaurant.data.cuisine }}</span>
          {% endif %}
        </div>

        <div class="dining-specs">
          <div class="spec-row">
            <span class="spec-label">Service:</span>
            <span class="spec-val">{{ restaurant.data.meals or 'Lunch & Dinner' }}</span>
          </div>
          <div class="spec-row">
            <span class="spec-label">Dress Code:</span>
            <span class="spec-val">{{ restaurant.data.dressCode or 'Resort Chic' }}</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="dining-card__body">
          {{ restaurant.templateContent | safe }}
        </div>
      </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>

  <!-- Booking Concierge Strip -->
  <section class="dining-cta-strip text-center">
    <div class="dining-cta-content">
      <h3>Ready to Taste the Experience?</h3>
      <p style="color: var(--color-espresso-soft); max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto 24px;">
        Restaurants, bars, and room service are generally included as part of your all-inclusive stay, though inclusions can vary and change&mdash;confirm current policy with the resort before you book.
      </p>
      <a href="/#availability" class="btn btn--primary">Check Live Dates & Availability</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</article>

<script>
  document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
    const pills = document.querySelectorAll('.dining-filter-pill');
    const cards = document.querySelectorAll('.dining-card');

    pills.forEach(pill => {
      pill.addEventListener('click', () => {
        pills.forEach(p => { p.classList.remove('is-active'); p.setAttribute('aria-pressed', 'false'); });
        pill.classList.add('is-active');
        pill.setAttribute('aria-pressed', 'true');

        const filter = pill.dataset.property;

        const status = document.getElementById('dining-filter-status');
        if (status) status.textContent = filter === 'all' ? 'Showing all restaurants.' : `Showing ${pill.textContent.trim()} restaurants.`;

        cards.forEach(card => {
          if (filter === 'all' || card.dataset.property === filter || card.dataset.property === 'both') {
            card.style.display = 'flex';
          } else {
            card.style.display = 'none';
          }
        });
      });
    });
  });
</script>